{"id": "7th-t2-pyq-q272", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-u2-kalai", "lesson_id": "lesson-08-thozhirpeyar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-pyq-grammar-thozhirpeyar-types-find", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பின்வரும் சொற்களுள் 'முதனிலை திரிந்த தொழிற்பெயர்' எவ்வரிசையில் மட்டும் சரியாக அமைந்துள்ளது?"}], "options": {"A": "தட்டு, உரை, அடி, வாழ்க", "B": "நடத்தல், ஆட்டம், விலை, பார்வை", "C": "கொல்லாமை, நடவாமை, செய்யாமை", "D": "சூடு, கேடு, பேறு, கோள்"}, "explanation": "முதனிலை திரிந்த தொழிற்பெயர்கள்:\nசுடு -> சூடு\nகெடு -> கேடு\nபெறு -> பேறு\nகொள் -> கோள்\nஇவை பகுதி (முதனிலை) நீண்டு திரிந்து தொழிற்பெயராக மாறியவை ஆகும். எனவே 'D' சரியான வரிசை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which of the following series are ONLY 'Muthannilai Thirinthathu' verbal nouns correctly listed?"}], "options": {"A": "Thattu, Urai, Adi, Vaazhga", "B": "Nadathal, Aattam, Vilai, Paarvai", "C": "Kollaamai, Nadavaamai, Seyyaamai", "D": "Soodu, Kedu, Paeru, Kol"}, "explanation": "'Soodu' (< sudu), 'Kedu' (< kedu), 'Paeru' (< peru), 'Kol' (< kol) are prime examples of Muthannilai Thirintha Thozhirpeyar where the root vowel lengthens."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Sa