{"id": "7th-t2-pyq-q277", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-azhiyaa-selvam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-pyq-quote-fill-naaladiyaar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நாலடியார் பாடல் அடியை நிறைவு செய்க:\n'வைப்புழிக் கோட்படா ________ கேடில்லை\nமிக்க சிறப்பின் அரசர் செறின்வவ்வார்.'"}], "options": {"A": "வாய்த்தீயிர்க்", "B": "நன்கீயிர்க்", "C": "பொன்செய்வர்க்", "D": "தானீயிர்க்"}, "explanation": "நாலடியார் பாடல்: 'வைப்புழிக் கோட்படா வாய்த்தீயிர்க் கேடில்லை மிக்க சிறப்பின் அரசர் செறின்வவ்வார்'. விடுபட்ட சீர் 'வாய்த்தீயிர்க்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Complete the famous verse from Naaladiyaar:\n'Vaippuzhik kotpada ________ kedillai\nmikka sirappin arasar serinvavvaar.'"}], "options": {"A": "Vaaytheeyirk", "B": "Nankeeyirk", "C": "Ponseyvark", "D": "Thaaneeyirk"}, "explanation": "Naaladiyaar line completes with 'vaaytheeyirk'. Option A is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": nul