{"id": "7th-t2-pyq-q299", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-06-iyal1-aivu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-pyq-iyal1-vocabulary-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கல்வி தொடர்பான ஆங்கிலக் கலைச்சொற்களைத் தமிழாக்கத்தோடு பொருத்துக:\n(a) Child Labour - 1. கோடை விடுமுறை\n(b) Summer Vacation - 2. ஒழுக்கம்\n(c) Discipline - 3. எழுத்தறிவு\n(d) Literacy - 4. குழந்தைத் தொழிலாளர்"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-2, d-3", "B": "a-4, b-2, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 20 கலைச்சொல் அறிவோம்:\nChild Labour = குழந்தைத் தொழிலாளர் (4)\nSummer Vacation = கோடை விடுமுறை (1)\nDiscipline = ஒழுக்கம் (2)\nLiteracy = எழுத்தறிவு (3).\nவரிசை: 4, 1, 2, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the education-related English terms with their Tamil translations:\n(a) Child Labour - 1. Summer Vacation\n(b) Summer Vacation - 2. Discipline\n(c) Discipline - 3. Literacy\n(d) Literacy - 4. Child Labour"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-2, d-3", "B": "a-4, b-2, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "Correct match: Child Labour = 4, Summer Vacation = 1, Discipline = 2, Literacy = 3. Sequence: 4, 1, 2, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "Child Labour", "content_en": "Child Labour"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "Summer Vacation", "content_en": "Summer Vacation"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "Discipline", "content_en": "Discipline"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "Literacy", "content_en": "Literacy"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "கோடை விடுமுறை", "content_en": "Summer Vacation"}, {"id": "R2", "conte